{"topic": "Gradient Descent and Learning Rate", "audience": "", "brief": {"objective": "学生能识别三种学习率调度策略的曲线形态，并解释各自的设计动机与适用场景。", "keyClaim": "自适应学习率调度通过动态调整学习率，在训练早期快速下降、后期精细收敛，以更长的训练步数换取更稳定的收敛结果。", "misconception": "", "visualTask": "视觉直接编码本页核心关系", "evidencePolicy": "none"}, "scene": {"id": "learning-rate-schedule", "kind": "content", "headline": "学习率调度：从固定到自适应", "lead": "固定学习率在训练后期易导致震荡或收敛缓慢；自适应调度通过动态调整学习率，在早期快速下降、后期精细收敛。", "notes": "本页通过动画对比 Step Decay、Cosine Annealing 和 Warmup 三种调度策略的学习率变化曲线，帮助学生直观理解不同策略的形态差异与收敛行为。", "blocks": [{"type": "sim", "engine": "widget", "html": "<style>
  .widget-lab {
    background: var(--bg2);
    border-radius: var(--radius, 12px);
    padding: 16px 20px 20px;
    color: var(--ink);
    height: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .widget-lab canvas {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: var(--radius, 8px);
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
  }
  .controls {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .controls button {
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: var(--radius, 6px);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 150ms, border-color 150ms, color 150ms;
  }
  .controls button:hover { background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .controls button:active { opacity: 0.7; }
  .readout {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-left: auto;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text2);
  }
  .readout span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
  .readout .dot { display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .lr-val { color: var(--ink); min-width: 48px; text-align: right; }
</style>
<div class="widget-lab">
  <canvas id="stage" width="680" height="360"></canvas>
  <div class="controls">
    <button id="pause_continue">⏸ 暂停</button>
    <button id="reset">↺ 重置</button>
    <div class="readout">
      <span><span class="dot" style="background:var(--accent);opacity:0.7"></span>固定 <span class="lr-val mono" id="lrFixed">0.010</span></span>
      <span><span class="dot" style="background:var(--accent);opacity:0.5"></span>步长 <span class="lr-val mono" id="lrStep">0.010</span></span>
      <span><span class="dot" style="background:var(--accent);opacity:0.3"></span>指数 <span class="lr-val mono" id="lrExp">0.010</span></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
  (function() {
    const root = document.documentElement;
    const tok = n => getComputedStyle(root).getPropertyValue(n).trim();
    const canvas = document.getElementById('stage');
    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
    const W = 680, H = 360;
    const MARGIN = { top: 24, right: 20, bottom: 28, left: 48 };
    const PLOT_W = W - MARGIN.left - MARGIN.right;
    const PLOT_H = H - MARGIN.top - MARGIN.bottom;
    const MAX_STEP = 200;
    const LOSS_MIN = 0, LOSS_MAX = 2.0;

    let step = 10;
    let paused = false;
    let loss_fixed = [1.8, 1.5, 1.2, 0.9, 0.7, 0.6, 0.55, 0.53, 0.52, 0.51];
    let loss_step = [1.8, 1.4, 1.0, 0.7, 0.5, 0.4, 0.35, 0.33, 0.32, 0.31];
    let loss_exp = [1.8, 1.3, 0.9, 0.6, 0.4, 0.3, 0.25, 0.22, 0.2, 0.19];
    let lr_fixed = 0.01;
    let lr_step = 0.01;
    let lr_exp = 0.01;

    const btnPause = document.getElementById('pause_continue');
    const btnReset = document.getElementById('reset');
    const elLrFixed = document.getElementById('lrFixed');
    const elLrStep = document.getElementById('lrStep');
    const elLrExp = document.getElementById('lrExp');

    function simulateStep() {
      lr_fixed = 0.01;
      lr_step = 0.01 * Math.pow(0.5, Math.floor(step / 50));
      lr_exp = 0.01 * Math.exp(-0.02 * step);
      let lf = loss_fixed[loss_fixed.length - 1];
      let ls = loss_step[loss_step.length - 1];
      let le = loss_exp[loss_exp.length - 1];
      lf = Math.max(0.05, lf - 0.0025);
      ls = Math.max(0.05, ls - 0.003 * (1 + 0.5 * Math.sin(step * 0.1)));
      le = Math.max(0.02, le * 0.985);
      loss_fixed.push(lf);
      loss_step.push(ls);
      loss_exp.push(le);
    }

    function draw() {
      const ink = tok('--ink');
      const text2 = tok('--text2');
      const line = tok('--line');
      const bg = tok('--bg');
      const accent = tok('--accent');

      ctx.clearRect(0, 0, W, H);
      ctx.fillStyle = bg;
      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);

      ctx.strokeStyle = line;
      ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;
      ctx.setLineDash([3, 4]);
      for (let i = 0; i <= 4; i++) {
        const y = MARGIN.top + (PLOT_H / 4) * i;
        ctx.beginPath();
        ctx.moveTo(MARGIN.left, y);
        ctx.lineTo(W - MARGIN.right, y);
        ctx.stroke();
      }
      ctx.setLineDash([]);

      ctx.strokeStyle = text2;
      ctx.lineWidth = 1;
      ctx.beginPath();
      ctx.moveTo(MARGIN.left, MARGIN.top);
      ctx.lineTo(MARGIN.left, H - MARGIN.bottom);
      ctx.lineTo(W - MARGIN.right, H - MARGIN.bottom);
      ctx.stroke();

      ctx.fillStyle = text2;
      ctx.font = '11px ' + tok('--mono');
      ctx.textAlign = 'center';
      ctx.textBaseline = 'top';
      ctx.fillText('步数', W / 2, H - 12);
      ctx.save();
      ctx.translate(12, H / 2);
      ctx.rotate(-Math.PI / 2);
      ctx.textAlign = 'center';
      ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';
      ctx.fillText('损失', 0, 0);
      ctx.restore();

      ctx.textAlign = 'right';
      ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';
      ctx.fillStyle = text2;
      ctx.font = '10px ' + tok('--mono');
      for (let i = 0; i <= 4; i++) {
        const val = LOSS_MAX - (LOSS_MAX / 4) * i;
        const y = MARGIN.top + (PLOT_H / 4) * i;
        ctx.fillText(val.toFixed(1), MARGIN.left - 8, y);
      }

      ctx.textAlign = 'center';
      ctx.textBaseline = 'top';
      for (let i = 0; i <= 4; i++) {
        const s = Math.round((MAX_STEP / 4) * i);
        const x = MARGIN.left + (PLOT_W / 4) * i;
        ctx.fillText(s, x, H - MARGIN.bottom + 4);
      }

      function mapX(s) { return MARGIN.left + (s / MAX_STEP) * PLOT_W; }
      function mapY(l) { return MARGIN.top + (1 - (l - LOSS_MIN) / (LOSS_MAX - LOSS_MIN)) * PLOT_H; }

      function drawCurve(data, color) {
        if (data.length < 2) return;
        ctx.beginPath();
        ctx.moveTo(mapX(0), mapY(data[0]));
        for (let i = 1; i < data.length; i++) {
          ctx.lineTo(mapX(i), mapY(data[i]));
        }
        ctx.strokeStyle = color;
        ctx.lineWidth = 2.5;
        ctx.stroke();
      }

      // Use accent with varying opacity for three curves
      drawCurve(loss_fixed, accent);
      ctx.globalAlpha = 0.7;
      drawCurve(loss_step, accent);
      ctx.globalAlpha = 0.4;
      drawCurve(loss_exp, accent);
      ctx.globalAlpha = 1.0;

      // legend
      const legendX = W - MARGIN.right - 100;
      const legendY = MARGIN.top + 8;
      ctx.font = '11px ' + tok('--sans');
      ctx.textAlign = 'left';
      ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';
      ctx.fillStyle = ink;
      ctx.fillText('固定学习率', legendX + 18, legendY);
      ctx.fillText('步长衰减', legendX + 18, legendY + 18);
      ctx.fillText('指数衰减', legendX + 18, legendY + 36);
      ctx.fillStyle = accent;
      ctx.fillRect(legendX, legendY - 3, 12, 3);
      ctx.globalAlpha = 0.7;
      ctx.fillRect(legendX, legendY + 15, 12, 3);
      ctx.globalAlpha = 0.4;
      ctx.fillRect(legendX, legendY + 33, 12, 3);
      ctx.globalAlpha = 1.0;

      ctx.fillStyle = text2;
      ctx.font = '11px ' + tok('--mono');
      ctx.textAlign = 'left';
      ctx.textBaseline = 'top';
      ctx.fillText('步数: ' + step, MARGIN.left, 4);

      elLrFixed.textContent = lr_fixed.toFixed(3);
      elLrStep.textContent = lr_step.toFixed(3);
      elLrExp.textContent = lr_exp.toFixed(3);
    }

    function update() { draw(); }

    let lastTime = 0;
    function loop(time) {
      if (!paused && step < MAX_STEP) {
        step++;
        simulateStep();
        update();
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(loop);
    }

    btnPause.addEventListener('click', () => {
      paused = !paused;
      btnPause.textContent = paused ? '▶ 继续' : '⏸ 暂停';
    });

    btnReset.addEventListener('click', () => {
      step = 0;
      loss_fixed = [1.8];
      loss_step = [1.8];
      loss_exp = [1.8];
      lr_fixed = 0.01;
      lr_step = 0.01;
      lr_exp = 0.01;
      paused = false;
      btnPause.textContent = '⏸ 暂停';
      update();
    });

    update();
    requestAnimationFrame(loop);
  })();
</script>", "spec": {"core_insight": "自适应学习率调度（如指数衰减、步长衰减）相比固定学习率，能在训练早期快速下降、后期精细收敛，以更多步数换取更稳定的收敛结果。", "render_medium": "canvas", "render_medium_reason": "需要实时绘制三条连续曲线（损失 vs 步数），并支持暂停/继续动画，canvas 更适合连续运动与动态重绘。", "state_model": [{"name": "step", "type": "int", "range": "0..200", "init": 0}, {"name": "paused", "type": "bool", "range": "true|false", "init": false}, {"name": "loss_fixed", "type": "array", "range": "0..2", "init": [1.8, 1.5, 1.2, 0.9, 0.7, 0.6, 0.55, 0.53, 0.52, 0.51]}, {"name": "loss_step", "type": "array", "range": "0..2", "init": [1.8, 1.4, 1.0, 0.7, 0.5, 0.4, 0.35, 0.33, 0.32, 0.31]}, {"name": "loss_exp", "type": "array", "range": "0..2", "init": [1.8, 1.3, 0.9, 0.6, 0.4, 0.3, 0.25, 0.22, 0.2, 0.19]}, {"name": "lr_fixed", "type": "float", "range": "0.01", "init": 0.01}, {"name": "lr_step", "type": "float", "range": "0.01..0.001", "init": 0.01}, {"name": "lr_exp", "type": "float", "range": "0.01..0.0001", "init": 0.01}], "interactions": [{"trigger": "button#pause_continue click", "effect": "切换 paused 状态，若 paused 为 true 则停止 step 递增，否则每帧 step++ 并追加 loss 值"}, {"trigger": "button#reset click", "effect": "重置 step=0，清空 loss 数组为初始值，恢复 lr 初值"}], "update": "每帧若 !paused，step++，根据当前 step 和三种调度策略计算当前学习率，再模拟损失下降（固定：线性缓慢下降；步长：每50步学习率减半，损失阶梯下降；指数：学习率指数衰减，损失平滑下降），将新损失值追加到对应数组末尾；然后清空 canvas，绘制三条曲线（固定=蓝，步长=橙，指数=绿），x轴为步数（0..step），y轴为损失（0..2），并在右上角显示当前学习率数值。", "initial_paint": "画布上已绘制三条曲线从步数0到10的初始段：蓝色固定学习率曲线缓慢下降（从1.8到0.51），橙色步长衰减曲线阶梯下降（从1.8到0.31），绿色指数衰减曲线平滑下降（从1.8到0.19）；右上角显示当前学习率：固定0.01，步长0.01，指数0.01；底部有暂停/继续按钮和重置按钮，动画处于运行状态（step=10，未暂停）。"}, "id": "b21"}, {"type": "list", "items": [{"lead": "固定学习率", "text": "整个训练过程使用同一学习率 $\eta$（如 0.01）。简单但后期易在最小值附近震荡，或收敛极慢。适用于小规模、快速实验。", "icon": "flask-conical"}, {"lead": "步长衰减", "text": "每经过固定轮数（如每 30 epoch）将学习率乘以衰减因子 $\gamma$（如 0.1）。早期大步下降，后期精细微调。适合中等规模、训练轮次可预估的任务。", "icon": "trending-down"}, {"lead": "指数衰减", "text": "学习率按指数函数递减：$\eta_t = \eta_0 \cdot e^{-kt}$。曲线平滑连续，无需手动设定衰减节点。适合需要极平滑收敛的模型（如某些生成模型）。", "icon": "wifi"}], "id": "b22"}, {"type": "callout", "label": "核心权衡", "text": "固定学习率简单但后期震荡；自适应调度以更多步数换取更稳收敛。", "id": "b23"}], "layout": {"kind": "compose", "areas": [{"blockIds": ["b21"], "col": [1, 9]}, {"blockIds": ["b22"], "col": [1, 7]}, {"blockIds": ["b23"], "col": [7, 11]}]}}, "referenceMaterial": "[none provided]"}

